{"id":"da1d07bee8918b64","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md","title":"ZFC Tree Level","display":"df-zfc-tree-level — ZFC Tree Level","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree-level","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree-level"],"display":"df-zfc-tree-level — ZFC Tree Level","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-collapse-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree-level"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree-level</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree-level — ZFC Tree Level"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"54516e12661b931e\" href=\"?note=54516e12661b931e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-collapse-map\">58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-collapse-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\alpha,T,R,\\alpha,\\pi\\in V\">\\(T_\\alpha,T,R,\\alpha,\\pi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为树的非严格偏序，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\)</span> is the strict-predecessor set supplied by the tree atom</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S\\)</span> (order-isomorphism to an ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"54516e12661b931e\" href=\"?note=54516e12661b931e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-collapse-map\">58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-collapse-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(T_\\alpha,T,R,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\nT_\\alpha=\\left\\{t\\in T\\middle|\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S\\!\\left(\n\\pi,\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t),\nR\\cap\\bigl(\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\times\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\bigr),\\alpha\n\\right)\\right\\}\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(T_\\alpha,T,R,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\nT_\\alpha=\\left\\{t\\in T\\middle|\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S\\!\\left(\n\\pi,\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t),\nR\\cap\\bigl(\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\times\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\bigr),\\alpha\n\\right)\\right\\}\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 与上游 <code>Tree</code> 一致地取非严格偏序；层高通过严格前驱集的序数坍缩来刻画，不再调用未声明的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}\">\\(\\operatorname{otp}\\)</span> 算子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-collapse-map","status":"resolved","id":"54516e12661b931e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-collapse-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2$（$R$ 为树的非严格偏序，see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$（see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-collapse-map","status":"resolved","id":"54516e12661b931e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S$ (order-isomorphism to an ordinal, see [[58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-collapse-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T_\\alpha,T,R,\\alpha,\\pi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}level} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(T_\\alpha,T,R,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\nT_\\alpha=\\left\\{t\\in T\\middle|\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalCollapseMap}_S\\!\\left(\n\\pi,\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t),\nR\\cap\\bigl(\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\times\\operatorname{Pred}(T,R,t)\\bigr),\\alpha\n\\right)\\right\\}\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otp}","display":false}],"bytes":1448,"backlinks":[{"id":"3846df0204470a95","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-tree-level]])"},{"id":"47ecd1e17d0a4400","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TreeLevel}_S(T_\\alpha,T,<_T,\\alpha)$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md]])"},{"id":"51544746a7792e0d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3755","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-tree-level.md|58-df-zfc-tree-level]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["f06e57c5c0b1354d","5582a281f15a33c2","54516e12661b931e"]}